6
00:00:09,124 --> 00:00:11,137
Part one: getting listing ready.

7
00:00:11,137 --> 00:00:13,150
This is Reian Creative Finance.

8
00:00:13,150 --> 00:00:15,611
Understanding markets. Following capital.

9
00:00:15,961 --> 00:00:17,509
First, what is a stock

10
00:00:17,509 --> 00:00:19,916
exchange? It's a regulated marketplace

11
00:00:19,916 --> 00:00:21,922
where shares in companies are

12
00:00:21,922 --> 00:00:23,011
bought and sold.

13
00:00:23,011 --> 00:00:24,845
In Zimbabwe you have three

14
00:00:24,845 --> 00:00:27,138
venues: the Zimbabwe Stock Exchange,

15
00:00:27,138 --> 00:00:29,373
the Victoria Falls Stock Exchange,

16
00:00:29,373 --> 00:00:31,207
which trades in US dollars,

17
00:00:31,207 --> 00:00:33,442
and FINSEC, an alternative trading

18
00:00:33,442 --> 00:00:35,792
platform licensed by the Securities

19
00:00:35,792 --> 00:00:37,913
and Exchange Commission in 2016.

20
00:00:38,263 --> 00:00:39,929
Next, three kinds of company.

21
00:00:39,929 --> 00:00:41,392
Under section 85 of the

22
00:00:41,392 --> 00:00:43,563
Companies and Other Business Entities

23
00:00:43,563 --> 00:00:45,178
Act, a private company must

24
00:00:45,178 --> 00:00:46,591
restrict share transfers,

25
00:00:46,591 --> 00:00:47,903
have no more than 50

26
00:00:47,903 --> 00:00:49,670
members, not counting employees,

27
00:00:49,670 --> 00:00:51,386
and cannot invite the public

28
00:00:51,386 --> 00:00:52,496
to buy its shares.

29
00:00:52,496 --> 00:00:54,061
A public company has none

30
00:00:54,061 --> 00:00:55,322
of those restrictions.

31
00:00:55,322 --> 00:00:56,786
And a listed company is

32
00:00:56,786 --> 00:00:58,553
a public company whose shares

33
00:00:58,553 --> 00:01:00,067
have been admitted to an

34
00:01:00,067 --> 00:01:01,934
exchange. Remember: public is not

35
00:01:01,934 --> 00:01:03,095
the same as listed.

36
00:01:03,445 --> 00:01:05,259
Before any exchange will look

37
00:01:05,259 --> 00:01:06,917
at you, get the foundations

38
00:01:06,917 --> 00:01:08,989
right. Be properly incorporated and

39
00:01:08,989 --> 00:01:10,648
registered. Keep clean books,

40
00:01:10,648 --> 00:01:12,928
with audited financial statements year

41
00:01:12,928 --> 00:01:14,378
after year. Have a real

42
00:01:14,378 --> 00:01:15,933
track record and a clear

43
00:01:15,933 --> 00:01:17,487
growth story. And tidy up

44
00:01:17,487 --> 00:01:19,560
your shareholder register and your

45
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:21,685
governance. Many companies spend two

46
00:01:21,685 --> 00:01:23,136
or three years on this

47
00:01:23,136 --> 00:01:23,861
stage alone.

48
00:01:24,211 --> 00:01:25,346
Now the numbers.

49
00:01:25,346 --> 00:01:27,078
Under section 87 of the

50
00:01:27,078 --> 00:01:28,810
ZSE Listings Requirements,

51
00:01:28,810 --> 00:01:30,722
a main board company needs

52
00:01:30,722 --> 00:01:32,992
subscribed capital of 10 million

53
00:01:32,992 --> 00:01:35,262
US dollars, a satisfactory profit

54
00:01:35,262 --> 00:01:37,113
history for the last five

55
00:01:37,113 --> 00:01:38,666
years where applicable,

56
00:01:38,666 --> 00:01:40,339
at least 30 percent of

57
00:01:40,339 --> 00:01:42,250
its shares in public hands,

58
00:01:42,250 --> 00:01:43,983
and at least 300 public

59
00:01:43,983 --> 00:01:44,819
shareholders.

60
00:01:45,169 --> 00:01:47,207
The VFEX, which trades in

61
00:01:47,207 --> 00:01:49,177
US dollars, sets a lower

62
00:01:49,177 --> 00:01:50,943
bar under rule 88 of

63
00:01:50,943 --> 00:01:52,166
its 2026 rules:

64
00:01:52,166 --> 00:01:54,679
subscribed capital of 3 million

65
00:01:54,679 --> 00:01:56,581
US dollars, at least 10

66
00:01:56,581 --> 00:01:58,483
million shares in issue,

67
00:01:58,483 --> 00:02:00,385
30 percent public float,

68
00:02:00,385 --> 00:02:02,287
and at least 50 public

69
00:02:02,287 --> 00:02:03,238
shareholders.

70
00:02:03,588 --> 00:02:05,408
Not every company fits the

71
00:02:05,408 --> 00:02:07,001
main board. The ZSE has

72
00:02:07,001 --> 00:02:09,220
a development stage route needing

73
00:02:09,220 --> 00:02:10,927
1.5 million US dollars of

74
00:02:10,927 --> 00:02:13,088
subscribed capital and no profit

75
00:02:13,088 --> 00:02:14,738
history, but with a bold

76
00:02:14,738 --> 00:02:17,071
risk warning. Exploration and mining

77
00:02:17,071 --> 00:02:19,062
companies can skip the profit

78
00:02:19,062 --> 00:02:20,996
test. The VFEX has specialist

79
00:02:20,996 --> 00:02:22,191
routes for mining,

80
00:02:22,191 --> 00:02:24,580
special purpose acquisition companies,

81
00:02:24,580 --> 00:02:26,799
green issuers, property trusts and

82
00:02:26,799 --> 00:02:27,140
more.

83
00:02:27,490 --> 00:02:29,136
You won't do this alone.

84
00:02:29,136 --> 00:02:31,252
You'll need a sponsoring broker,

85
00:02:31,252 --> 00:02:33,368
who guides the application and

86
00:02:33,368 --> 00:02:35,014
deals with the exchange.

87
00:02:35,014 --> 00:02:36,837
The ZSE rules require one

88
00:02:36,837 --> 00:02:38,365
in the cases set out

89
00:02:38,365 --> 00:02:39,893
in sections 16 to 19.

90
00:02:39,893 --> 00:02:41,480
Add legal practitioners,

91
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:43,714
auditors, and a corporate finance

92
00:02:43,714 --> 00:02:45,772
