93
00:02:45,772 --> 00:02:46,477
the offer.

94
00:02:46,827 --> 00:02:48,255
Then the prospectus:

95
00:02:48,255 --> 00:02:50,678
the document that tells investors

96
00:02:50,678 --> 00:02:53,348
everything material about the company

97
00:02:53,348 --> 00:02:54,404
and the offer.

98
00:02:54,404 --> 00:02:56,515
The Companies Act deals with

99
00:02:56,515 --> 00:02:58,813
prospectuses in sections 104 to

100
00:02:58,813 --> 00:03:00,739
114, and section 108 makes

101
00:03:00,739 --> 00:03:02,974
people liable for misstatements.

102
00:03:02,974 --> 00:03:04,651
So every number in it

103
00:03:04,651 --> 00:03:05,707
